e business reasons provided.", "findings": [{"claim": "Ran out of turns. Records gathered: ctgov:NCT05065411.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT05065411"], "confidence": "low", "notes": ""}], "gaps": ["Researcher hit the 8-turn cap before finishing: Identify the CIK for Veru Inc. (historically linked to Female Health Co, CIK 0000863436). Search SEC EDGAR filings, specifically Form 8-K, 10-Q, and 10-K, around the termination date of the Phase 3 EN"]}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 1, "brief": "Retrieve and review the 5 publications associated with NCT05065411 on PubMed or Europe PMC. Determine what results, abstracts, or updates have been published regarding this Phase 3 trial, its safety/efficacy profile, or its termination.", "findings": [{"claim": "Five publications (PMID: 38067367, PMID: 38203649, PMID: 38339092, PMID: 41388212, PMID: 42092921) are linked to trial NCT05065411 via Europe PMC literature mentions.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:38067367", "pubmed:38203649", "pubmed:38339092", "pubmed:41388212", "pubmed:42092921"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "All five articles link to the trial via Europe PMC text mining or drug name/trial ID mentions rather than direct primary trial reporting."}, {"claim": "None of the five publications report primary results, specific safety/efficacy data, or termination reasons for trial NCT05065411.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:38067367", "pubmed:38203649", "pubmed:38339092", "pubmed:41388212", "pubmed:42092921"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "The articles are broad review papers discussing androgen receptors, breast cancer treatments, and CDK4/6 inhibitors."}, {"claim": "PMID: 38067367 discusses targeting androgen receptors in TNBC and analyzing clinical trial combination therapies.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:38067367"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Abstract mentions: 'studying how AR functions in tandem with these molecules can have increasing breakthroughs in the treatment options for TNBC.'"}, {"claim": "PMID: 38203649 revi